---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import pages from "../../data/pages.json";
---

<SiteLayout metadata={pages["/switch/"]}>
  <main id="main" class="growth-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <a href="/tools/">Resources</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <span aria-current="page">
          Plan the move before you move the records.
        </span>
      </nav>
      <header class="growth-hero">
        <div class="eyebrow">A considered move</div>
        <h1>Plan the move before you move the records.</h1>
        <p>
          We’d confirm what can transfer, who owns each step, and how you’ll
          check the result before choosing a cutover date.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="resource-cards">
        <a class="resource-card" href="/switch/from-simplepractice/">
          <span class="tag">Moving from SimplePractice</span>
          <h3>Prepare your SimplePractice exports</h3>
          <p>
            Identify the export types, permissions, and records that need a
            separate check.
          </p>
          <span class="text-link">See the checklist ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="resource-card" href="/switch/from-therapynotes/">
          <span class="tag">Moving from TherapyNotes</span>
          <h3>Prepare your TherapyNotes records</h3>
          <p>
            Plan document downloads, confirm other export categories, and
            validate a sample.
          </p>
          <span class="text-link">See the checklist ↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <section class="growth-section prose">
        <h2>Get the transfer scope in writing.</h2>
        <p>
          Ask Otto to confirm accepted file formats, importable fields,
          attachments, signatures, historical notes, balances, calendars, fees,
          timing, and the secure transfer method. Import support has not been
          verified in this review site.
        </p>
        <h2>Test a small, representative sample.</h2>
        <p>
          Agree on the test and acceptance criteria with the receiving team.
          Compare record counts and inspect document readability, author
          attribution, dates, and links to the correct client. Track exceptions
          before transferring more records.
        </p>
        <h2>Protect continuity of care.</h2>
        <p>
          Plan an overlap period, explain any portal or payment changes to
          clients, and preserve access to records under your practice’s
          retention obligations. Close an old account only after the responsible
          owner has accepted the transfer and confirmed continued record access.
        </p>
      </section>
      <a class="button" href="/waitlist/">
        Talk to us about your workflow ↗
      </a>
    </div>
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="cta">
          <div>
            <h2>Make more room for the work you love.</h2>
            <p>
              See how Otto brings notes, scheduling, telehealth, and payments
              into your practice day.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="button light" href="/waitlist/">
            Join the waitlist <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
